⏰ REMINDER TIMING (Respect Timezone)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Business sends reminders at fixed UTC time:
- 24 hours before: 14:00 UTC (example)
- 1 hour before: 14:00 UTC (day of meeting)

Convert to customer timezone:
- Customer in NY (EDT): 10:00am, 10:00am
- Customer in Madrid (CEST): 4:00pm, 4:00pm
- Customer in Tokyo (JST): 11:00pm, 11:00pm

Result: Each customer gets reminder at appropriate time in their zone
✅ No one gets 3am reminder!


